      "message": "I meant to copy what WeakRefData did. I guess WeakRefData just calls `object-\u003emRefCount.TryIncrement()` directly but similar idea.\n\nAnyways I made TryAddRef() public and got rid of both friend classes. Dawn native code shouldn\u0027t really be calling TryAddRef() or AddRef(), instead using Ref\u003cT\u003e instead, but AddRef() is already public so having TryAddRef() public isn\u0027t the end of the world.\n\nI can move it back to private+friend classes if someone objects.",
